---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="打赏">
  <article class="page glass">
    <h1><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 8h1a3 3 0 0 1 0 6h-1"/><path d="M3 8h14v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4z"/><path d="M6 2v2M10 2v2M14 2v2"/></svg>打赏</h1>
    <p>如果觉得这个博客对你有帮助，可以请我喝杯咖啡 ☕</p>
    <div class="donate-grid">
      <div class="donate-item">
        <img src="/images/wechat-qr.png" alt="微信扫码" loading="lazy" />
        <span>微信扫码</span>
      </div>
      <div class="donate-item">
        <img src="/images/alipay-qr.png" alt="支付宝扫码" loading="lazy" />
        <span>支付宝扫码</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
